  clock: 7  # ab1b
  nonce: ab1b  # ab1b
  message: "ADR-0043 §6.1's ratified emission_counts sub-step (recompute files_analyzed/files_skipped per-run by origin_run_id over the final substrate) was found UNSOUND and REMOVED from finalize in run-lifecycle:F1 (PR #236) — NOT stubbed. files_analyzed is contractually a FILE count (== profile.languages[L].files, pinned by test_inv_hokig/test_profile), but the per-origin_run_id recompute yields a NODE/path count and does not close this item (IR-consuming passes stay 0; the 6 scan-linkers would regress to 0). This item OWNS the real fix: a NEW provenance field (e.g. ir_units_processed / pass_kind) that does NOT overload files_analyzed. Re-ratification recorded in ADR §6.1 ratified sub-decision #5."  # ab1b
